1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:06,625
When reading a paper, a relevant figure
may be too far from the text to see.

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:12,575
When that happens, use the clipping feature
in the viewer to keep it nearby.

3
00:00:14,300 --> 00:00:21,225
The result is a movable clip. Resize it to fit,
then place it beside the text.

4
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:24,625
You can also send the clip to a board.

5
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:30,000
A pinned clip moves with the paper
as you scroll.

6
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:35,700
Choose Free float and scroll.
The clip stays in place.

7
00:00:37,650 --> 00:00:39,825
Enjoy Papol.
